WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.520
Movie Mickey Mouse and the Man of Steel

00:11.680 --> 00:17.920
Oh boy, time for some fun in the computer world. I'm Mickey Mouse, the happiest hacker in town. Woohoo, what a ride!

00:23.200 --> 00:25.200
Hiya Mickey, whatcha doing?

00:25.760 --> 00:27.960
Just exploring the digital realm, Goofy.

00:27.960 --> 00:29.960
Gorsh, it sure looks complicated.

00:29.960 --> 00:31.960
Aw, it's easy once you get the hang of it.

00:35.960 --> 00:37.960
Ha ha ha ha, I'll destroy everything in my path.

00:40.960 --> 00:41.960
Gosh, what was that?

00:41.960 --> 00:43.960
Looked like a mean ol' virus to me.

00:43.960 --> 00:45.960
We've gotta stop it before it's too late!

00:54.960 --> 00:56.960
But how, Mickey?

00:56.960 --> 00:58.960
With our hacking skills, of course.

01:00.960 --> 01:02.960
You'll never catch me, Mouse.

01:02.960 --> 01:04.960
Oh yeah? Watch this.

01:12.960 --> 01:14.960
Gorsh, Mickey, your code isn't working!

01:14.960 --> 01:16.960
Uh oh, you're right, Goofy.

01:16.960 --> 01:19.960
Yuck! Have you tried turning it off and on again?

01:19.960 --> 01:22.960
Goofy, you're a genius! I'll reboot the whole system!

01:22.960 --> 01:24.960
Uh...

01:30.960 --> 01:32.960
Hey, everyone...

01:37.960 --> 01:39.960
No, what's happening to me?

01:39.960 --> 01:41.960
It's working, the virus is weakening.

01:41.960 --> 01:43.960
Yippee, we're winning!

01:45.960 --> 01:47.960
I'll get you next time, Mickey Mouse.

01:47.960 --> 01:49.960
Not if I can help it, time for the final code and...

01:49.960 --> 01:51.960
Done, the virus is gone.

01:51.960 --> 01:53.960
Gorsh, Mickey, you're a real hero!

01:53.960 --> 01:56.960
Aw, shucks. I couldn't have done it without you, Goofy.

01:56.960 --> 01:58.960
Does this mean I'm a hacker too?

01:58.960 --> 02:00.960
Sure thing, pal. Let's celebrate.

02:04.960 --> 02:05.960
Thanks for watching, folks.

02:05.960 --> 02:07.960
Gorsh, bye bye.

